        "TileImage": "$($repository aaf4d45f-0a1f-42fb-917d-d12fb62ad068).Image",
        "Description": "So I, uh, only wanted to try out my new garlic salt, but then it turned out I used the poison instead, so I tried to get the other garlic salt but then that damn fool sea captain was being weird and accidentally fell on some of my bullets, but then there was some other guy being weird so he accidentally fell on top of my bullets too and then that nurse was a bit mean so she totally fell on some bullets and then I had to go because man this holiday got a bit weird.",
